00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:14.800
So, this game is about... getting angry.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.280
Which is something that I don't understand.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.240
So I thought it would be a good opportunity,

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.580
For the sweet, innocent, baby boy that I am,

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:23.960
