00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:27.700
Why not?

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.160
Lemme try my best here.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.040
All right! Here we go! I'mma-- OoOOh!

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:36.480
